  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) per dose<br><strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (24 hours): without a Cyberspine, beat DV17 Resist Torture/Drugs or suffer Spinal Injury's effect (not its Bonus Damage) for the duration; Critical Injuries deal no Bonus Damage; STAT and check penalties from Critical Injuries are halved (other effects remain); Medtechs treating you get +1 to Surgery; you're exhausted and disoriented. Secondary (DV17): you can't remember what happened during the high; if addicted to Berserker or Black Lace, take 1d6 Humanity Loss; addiction. While addicted and not on Blue Butter: INT and COOL -2.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>While addicted, switch on the \"Blue Butter Addiction\" effect.</li><li>When an addicted character doses, use \"Blue Butter Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li><li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
